MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Richard Kaysen, and City Council
FROM:

Sara Vasquez, Asst. Director of Purchasing
DATE:

March 20, 2013
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #R-24-13, for furnishing and installing Play Systems for JL
Ranch Park for the City’s Parks & Recreation Department.
______________________________________________
We had four bidders respond to this bid, and the bid tab is below.
1. Great Western Park & Playground

$42,852.20
Wellsville, UT

2. BCI Burke Company LLC, d/b/a Made in the Schade
$49,999.00
Evergreen, CO

3. Miracle Recreation Equipment Co.

$56,939.00
Niwot, CO

4. Play Power LT Farmington d/b/a Recreation Plus

$66,121.00
Golden, CO

The bids were reviewed by Todd Feezer and Teresa Moore and their recommendation is to
accept the low bid from Great Western Park & Playground of Wellsville, UT for a total amount
of 42,852.20.  This includes two playground systems, installation, and safety surfacing.

Funding:
013-21-2111-45-43903 (community facility fees)
```
